0001D1r 2               
0001D1r 2               ; CopyVram - T1:T0 bytes from (PTR0) to where the chip points.
0001D1r 2               CopyVram:
0001D1r 2  A6 41          ldx T1
0001D3r 2  F0 0F          beq @tail
0001D5r 2  A0 00          ldy #0
