000626r 2               ; --- Planning ---
000626r 2               ;
000626r 2               ; B swaps through what the ship can do this turn: Laser, Torpedo, then its
000626r 2               ; special if it's ready. A Raider's mine goes with the shot, so it adds Laser and
000626r 2               ; Torpedo with a mine. A flak shell is aimed like a shot but only so far; a cloak
000626r 2               ; needs no aim; a jump replaces the move and needs no aim.
000626r 2               
000626r 2               EnterPlan:
000626r 2  A9 02          lda #ST_PLAN
000628r 2  85 6E          sta STATE
00062Ar 2  A9 00          lda #PH_MOVE
00062Cr 2  85 70          sta PHASE
00062Er 2  64 8C          stz HAS_AIM
000630r 2  A6 6F          ldx PLAYER
000632r 2  86 76          stx VIEWER
000634r 2  9E 84 09       stz PLAN_SPECIAL,x
000637r 2  BD 18 08       lda SHIP_C,x
00063Ar 2  85 71          sta CUR_C
00063Cr 2  BD 1C 08       lda SHIP_R,x
00063Fr 2  85 72          sta CUR_R
000641r 2  20 rr rr       jsr ClearMessages
000644r 2  20 rr rr       jsr IsLink
