00082Dr 2  88             dey
00082Er 2  D0 F5          bne @shift
000830r 2  60             rts
000831r 2               
000831r 2               ; --- Music ---
000831r 2               
000831r 2               ; ChooseTune - start the tune asked for, or stop if music is off.
000831r 2               ChooseTune:
000831r 2  AD 2D 0F       lda MUS_ON
000834r 2  F0 03          beq @wanted
000836r 2  AD 2C 0F       lda MUS_WANT
000839r 2               @wanted:
