000918r 2  9E 44 0F       stz M_GATE,x
00091Br 2  9E 47 0F       stz M_RATE,x
00091Er 2  60             rts
00091Fr 2               
00091Fr 2               ; StartNote - note S_B with instrument S_C on track X.
00091Fr 2               StartNote:
00091Fr 2  A5 DA          lda S_C
000921r 2  0A             asl a
000922r 2  0A             asl a
000923r 2  0A             asl a
